		<SimpleData name="stream_name">Octopus Creek</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="barrier">Beaver dams at mouth and ~1.5 miles above lake; very steep bedrock canyon 3/4 mile from Francois Lake with chutes and drops up to 6 feet, free of loose rock, would be impassable; access absolutely nil (lower: active beaver dams; upper: falls and beaver dams)</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="habitat_value">Spawning 5 / Rearing 5 (1=excellent/extensive, 5=nil/very marginal)</SimpleData>
		<SimpleData name="recommendation">Not worth considering or examining further for fish production (per report conclusion)</SimpleData>
